acceptance_criteria: Replaying the advertised cursor of a budget-driven second triage projection against unchanged rows and options resumes after the last delivered row; A changed source still refuses the cursor with read_output_cursor_stale; Coverage includes the second-projection case and the adjacent passing paddings as controls
parent: pm-5t33or
risk: medium
confidence: high
severity: medium
expected_result: An output cursor from the first response resumes after its last delivered row when the same query and item data are replayed; the stale refusal remains only for a changed source.
actual_result: With filter padding 136 the first response delivers 12 rows and advertises a cursor that the unchanged replay refuses with read_output_cursor_stale; paddings 134 and 138 replay successfully.
